;				EF 40 18  Winbond W25Q128 compatible
;
;			Operational mode:
;				- WREN / status / erase: 1-bit SPI commands through QUADSPI
;				- Program: Quad Input Page Program 0x32
;				- Read: Fast Read Quad I/O 0xEB
;
;			Important STM32 QUADSPI note:
;				For transactions with address phase, configure CCR first, then write AR.
